[
    {
        "id": 74997,
        "ticket_id": 24356,
        "type_id": 5,
        "sender_id": 2,
        "from": "Magda Borkowska <m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk>",
        "to": "Support",
        "cc": null,
        "subject": null,
        "reply_to": null,
        "message_id": null,
        "message_id_md5": null,
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<br><br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong dir=\"auto\">Borkowska, Magda</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href=\"mailto:m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk\">m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Tue, Sep 10, 2024 at 1:15 AM<br>Subject: a few queries<br>To: <a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt;<br>\n</div>\n<br><br><div><div lang=\"EN-GB\">\n<div>\n<p>Hi Sara,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Hope you’re well. I’ve got a few further queries if that’s OK.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n<li>I recently exported some GPS data, which suggest that Avicenna’s app only collected 2 days of my GPS data (on the 29<sup>th</sup> of August and 1<sup>st</sup> of September). Is that correct? If yes, are you able to investigate why my GPS data hasn’t been collected every day? </li>\n<li>Given the issues with sending notifications on Huawei and Xiaomi phones, we would like to ask participants to choose how they want to receive push notifications to complete the daily survey (whether they prefer app notification, email or sms). Can we do that during our sample study please? What’s the cost of sending an sms? </li>\n<li>Finally, our GPS consultants would like to get as much detail as possible about the way that GPS data is currently collected via the Avicenna app. Are you able to send over some information? </li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Many thanks Sara for all your help.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Magda</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div>ᐧ</div>",
        "internal": false,
        "preferences": {},
        "updated_by_id": 478,
        "created_by_id": 478,
        "origin_by_id": 6487,
