        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Hi team,</span><br>\n</div><div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>I have split this ticket to specifically request that the team review the first inquiry above. This inquiry is from the same client for whom we are providing ISO 27001 certification, making it a matter of the highest priority. This issue must be thoroughly investigated, as it is the single most important aspect of their study. Failing to address this could result in a breach of the entire contract! <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><b>Please don't get back to her directly here and just keep me informed.</b></span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Thanks,</div>\n<div>Sara</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>P.S. Study ID: 3950 - Participants ID: 99472</div>\n</div>",
