        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<a href=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/478\" data-mention-user-id=\"478\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/478\">Sara Farnya</a> i don't have a Huawei phone but after a search, i think the device is killing the app on BG and will not allow starting the app on BG. To resolve this: <br><div>To do this, choose Phone Manager &gt; App Startup Management &gt; Disable Automatic Management &gt; Allow Auto Startup or Allow Background Activities.</div><div>Or</div>Touch Quick setting to enter Settings on your phone, search for App launch, open it, disable the switch for Avicenna, and in the displayed Manage manually pop-up window, enable Auto-launch and Run in background.<span style=\"color:rgb(12, 13, 14);\"><br></span>And then reload the studies.<br><br>Should i inform the client?<div><br></div>",
